WEBVTT

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.400
There once was a little girl.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:11.750
The girl's parents passed away when she was young.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:16.070
She grew up without experiencing the love
that develops between people.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.800
"I want to know true love."

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.020
The girl tried to find love with lots of guys.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:30.840
However, none of them were able to steal her heart.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.360
She searched and searched.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.430
She got hurt, but kept searching.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:46.940
The girl finally found her one and only love.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:53.650
However, her only family said:

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.820
"That's not love.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.740
I'll never forgive you.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.180
It's not normal."

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:06.100
The girl, angry that her love was criticized,

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.500
killed her aunt.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.810
That's my imagination.

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:18.510
But I don't think I'm that far from the truth.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:22.680
What is the truth?

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.430
Is it that?

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:27.230
Or something else?

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:32.190
I can't forgive her.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:37.360
I'm the only one who should know your secret.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.930
Right, Matsuzaka?

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.810
Are you calling home?

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:23.140
Oh, yeah. Something like that.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.780
I didn't know you lived around here.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.160
Yeah. It's close to where I work.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.240
It's good to live somewhere convenient.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:32.540
It keeps me motivated.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:35.820
You live an hour away, right?

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.230
Yeah. It does take an hour.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.740
Well, that was on purpose though.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:48.370
I had a hard time at home and at school.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:53.250
I always felt my heart was tied up.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.640
But I felt different when I was with you.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:00.800
I was able to be my real self.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.320
That had never happened to me before.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:06.720
Right now, I feel really liberated.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.820
I'm glad I work where I do now.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.770
Because I met you.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.870
Thanks, Satou.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.860
Me too.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:22.530
I like talking to you.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.880
I can relax.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.170
And I'm happier now.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:30.700
I was able to forget the unpleasant memories.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.870
I thought, "Friends are great!"

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.550
We get along well.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:41.710
I'm glad I met you too.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:48.470
-Shoko-chan?
-Don't make me cry.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:54.410
I'm really glad I worked up the courage.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:56.240
Shoko-chan, you're so cute.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:59.370
You're the one who's cute!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.610
Hida!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.460
You're going to Matsuzaka's house? How--?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.490
No, it's too dangerous!

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:10.800
My Shio-chan!

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:14.070
This is it. This apartment.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:17.000
What? Isn't this...?

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.380
You live here, Satou?

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.970
And your lover?

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:33.640
But no one answered when I rang the doorbell.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.060
I'm sure of it.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.790
I've been here before.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.650
Do you live here?

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.880
The police?

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:51.200
Someone reported a strange smell
coming from this room.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.010
No one answered when we rang the doorbell.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.750
May we look inside?

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.420
The perfect place for cutting up a body.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.590
Her own apartment.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:07.430
That bag of trash Matsuzaka asked me to dispose of...

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:11.490
I bet her missing aunt was inside.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.450
If so,

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:17.730
there's a good chance there are traces
left inside her apartment.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.490
Matsuzaka...

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:22.820
I won't let you...

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.400
share our secret with anyone else.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.690
If you do,

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.660
I'll tell everyone!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.630
But we're talking about Matsuzaka,

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:34.140
and she might be able to dodge this smoothly.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.340
Right now isn't convenient for me.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:45.670
There's been a report. We have to check.

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:51.050
Will you please cooperate?

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.280
Okay.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.780
No way.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:59.770
No way. No way...

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.690
That look on your face...

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:05.790
Are you for real?

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:09.610
Are you so panicked
that you can't come up with a cover?

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.170
So does that mean

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:14.530
there's something in your apartment
that'll get you in trouble?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:18.200
This is bad. Hold it in. Hold it in...

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:22.130
She'll hear!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.540
What's happening?

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:30.680
The same Matsuzaka who looked down on me,
stepped on me, and scolded me...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.320
I brought...

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:35.530
her secret...

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:39.180
to light!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.450
Right now,

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:46.690
you must be desperately thinking
about how to get out of this situation.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.900
This is bad, right?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.200
If they find any traces,

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.990
I don't know what will happen to me
since I threw it away.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.660
But I want to see this.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.750
I want to see this! I want to see this!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.660
I want to see her panic!

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:05.520
That's the only thing that'll bring me ecstasy!

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.340
I'll think about...

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:11.260
everything else later!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.730
Matsuzaka!

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:15.680
Hey, Satou.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:21.770
What was that just now?

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.540
I'm home.

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:28.070
It's me.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.560
Who are you?

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.730
Me?

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:14.610
I'm her

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.450
I'm Satou's aunt.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.790
No way!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.710
Then what was in that trash bag?

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.140
I don't understand.

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:31.710
What is going on?

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.550
This is my sign for...

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.990
calling her.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:44.160
We rang the doorbell several times.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:47.770
Can we talk to you right now?

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:51.080
Oh, I'm sorry I didn't notice.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.540
What do you want to talk about?

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.830
Well...

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:59.070
Someone reported a strange smell
coming from this room.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:01.660
We want to look inside.

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:04.180
Are you with the police?

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:05.430
Yes.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:08.310
That must be a hard job.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:13.560
But there's nothing inside this apartment.

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:15.880
We want to check.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.240
Check?

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:24.100
Come inside.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.520
Excuse me.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.330
Satou's aunt?

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.690
Who are you?

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.790
Oh, yeah, nice to meet you!

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:37.380
I'm Shoko Hida.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.450
I'm her friend from work.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.740
You come inside too.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:47.680
Satou-chan, don't just stand there.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.290
Wait!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.440
What? It's--

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.130
This place...

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.610
It's dark.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.720
It's not even night yet.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.050
Come inside.

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:04.890
Okay.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.370
Why does it feel so damp?

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:14.230
And it smells kind of weird...

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.820
I don't want to stay here long.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.460
How was it?

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:22.250
I didn't find anything dangerous.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.080
And no one else is here.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:26.470
Where haven't we looked yet?

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:28.640
Satou...

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.040
Excuse me.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.880
What about this room? It's locked.

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.100
Oh, yes.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.550
There's trash in that room.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:43.900
I thought the smell might go away if I locked it.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.350
Can you open it?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.720
No.

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.890
It smells, you know!

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:54.060
It'll make me gag! So I don't want to.

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:56.080
Can you open it?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.530
-Probably.
-What?

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:00.540
Wait! I said no!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.670
Excuse me. Stay back.

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:03.820
Excuse me.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:05.760
-No--
-Stay back.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.590
It opened.

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:17.670
See?

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.770
We'll check here too.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.630
Go ahead.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:25.740
Watch your feet.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:27.510
Hey, Satou.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.140
Is this really...

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.780
where you live?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.630
That's right.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:45.660
There was nothing wrong in particular.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.800
But... That room...

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.970
Yes. I'll clean up.

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:51.330
Please do that.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.010
That might be the cause of the smell.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:55.720
And it's not sanitary.

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:59.050
It isn't a good environment for a child.

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.860
Why are you laughing?

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.020
It's nothing. Sorry.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.510
You know...

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:19.610
I just thought being a policeman was a tough job.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:22.990
Hey, policeman.

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:25.360
How many days have you gone without?

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.420
Poor thing.

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:30.790
Don't you ever comfort yourself?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:33.910
Hey. Let me go.

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.680
-I knew it.
-Stop.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:39.640
You've always wanted to be a policeman
ever since you were a kid.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:44.340
You were always studying and never played.

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:49.070
You didn't criticize the dirty room
and went in anyway.

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:52.450
You do lots of busy-work.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:55.140
You're a hard-working, good boy.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:59.310
But sometimes you get lonely.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:04.650
That's why sometimes you wonder
if you're a boring person.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:07.750
Being hard-working is your only strength.

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:09.590
You have nothing else.

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:12.080
You're a boring person.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.160
You!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.360
Kose!

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:19.220
Go ahead. Hit me.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:22.050
Hit me, and you'll feel better.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.590
Hey.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:32.350
You don't have to hold back.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:36.680
It'll make you feel really good.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:40.290
Hit my face as hard as you can,

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.910
punch me in the stomach, and yell at me.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:46.490
And then rip off my clothes,

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:49.990
and do whatever you want to me.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:53.660
It's nothing to be embarrassed about.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:57.010
It's who you really are,

00:14:57.010 --> 00:15:00.830
and it's the most important part of your heart.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:04.440
I'll love you, even if that's the way you are.

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:08.300
You can use me as your outlet.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.190
See?

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.530
You're a good boy.

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:16.720
Forget about the world outside.

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:21.600
You can suck on them.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.820
You can act like a little kid,

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:27.210
or you can be violent.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:30.610
You can do anything you want to me.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:33.240
It's okay.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.250
I don't care what you do.

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:40.830
I'll swallow up any desire.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:44.750
That's what love is.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:50.840
See? Only me...

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.800
What are you doing?

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.140
You're lonely too, aren't you?

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:01.740
If you're lonely, I'll accept you anytime.

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.020
No, thank you.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.120
Let's go.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.860
Don't hold back!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.900
I'll always...

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.970
be here.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.350
What?

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:23.680
You look a little lonely too.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.710
Are you starving for love?

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.380
That's right.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:32.530
I hope you find your one and only prince.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.600
You never do change, Aunt.

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:46.480
Her voice is kind.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:52.990
But her voice is also creepy
and sticks in my head.

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:58.830
Hey, Satou! Who is she?

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.590
I know she's your aunt, but...

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:03.170
But...

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.960
She's weird!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.930
She acted out like that so suddenly...

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:08.670
talking about love...

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.970
I'm sorry.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:18.640
To her, that's love.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.430
She accepts all people's desires.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:26.150
Violence, sex, anything and everything.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:30.820
She feels happy accepting those things from others.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:34.990
I was raised by her.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:39.070
We're related by blood.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.910
Shoko-chan,

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.620
will you still be my friend?

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.780
Satou...

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:56.720
you're the only friend I have
who I can talk to about what I really feel.

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.180
Shoko-chan.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.070
Stupid Satou!

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:07.690
Of course!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.430
Sorry, Shoko-chan.

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.870
Sorry to surprise you.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:29.080
Forget everything.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:33.590
Let's be friends from work again tomorrow,
like always.

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:37.940
No, Satou.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:39.860
I want to face you.

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:43.060
If you're hurting, I want to help you.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:45.160
Satou! I...

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.980
I didn't know...

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.900
that my half-hearted courage...

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:56.380
could hurt others so badly.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.620
Hey, Satou.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:11.080
Your aunt is weird.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:12.850
Hey.

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:15.420
Maybe you're weird too.

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:20.060
I remembered something painful again
after a long time.

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:22.100
It was always like that.

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:25.820
But it doesn't matter anymore.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.890
That's how it is.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:34.190
So stop following me
and trying to pry into my life.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.610
Teacher.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:39.280
Then what was in that bag?

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:43.050
An obedient dog should go straight home

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:47.750
and have his wife tell him, "Good boy!"

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.080
Or else,

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.600
I'll never give you a treat ever again.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.500
Okay?

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:57.810
Okay.

00:19:57.810 --> 00:19:59.770
Okay! Good boy!

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:02.070
Goodbye!

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:41.220
Satou-chan! Welcome back!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.280
I'm home, Shio-chan!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:51.360
Hey, Shio-chan.

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:53.320
Do you know what a friend is?

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:54.980
Friend?

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:58.650
Friend? Friend?

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:02.320
I don't know! What's a friend?

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:06.460
I don't really know either.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:08.840
What is a friend?

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.200
You're weird, Satou-chan!

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:13.510
I don't care.

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:16.180
As long as Shio-chan is with me.

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:21.190
That's enough for me.

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:33.850
It's nothing.

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:37.660
Why?

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:40.980
It's because I don't want to go home.

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:49.170
Hey.

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:52.740
You're letting me stay. I'll pay you back.

00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:56.160
What do you want me to do?

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:00.930
Model for your art?

00:24:06.020 --> 00:24:08.210
Hey...

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:11.890
Do you know what love is?

00:24:13.230 --> 00:24:16.650
I wanted to know what love was
and feel satisfied.

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:19.530
Hey, does it exist?

00:24:19.530 --> 00:24:22.230
Love that isn't overbearing?

00:24:22.830 --> 00:24:26.900
"8th Life: Apartment No. 1208"
